# A rownum filter after a map must reach the row lookup, otherwise the map hides the fast path.

admin 'create table test::t16 { id: int4, a: int4 }'
---
> +---------+-------------+---------+-----------+
> |   id    |  namespace  |  table  |  created  |
> +---------+-------------+---------+-----------+
> |  16388  |    test     |   t16   |   true    |
> +---------+-------------+---------+-----------+
>

query 'CALL rql::explain("from test::t16 map {id, a} filter {rownum == 1}")'
---
> +-------+---------+----------+------------------+--------------------+
> |  idx  |  depth  |  parent  |       kind       |       detail       |
> +-------+---------+----------+------------------+--------------------+
> |   0   |    0    |   none   |       Map        |       id, a        |
> |   1   |    1    |    0     |  RowPointLookup  |  source=t16 row=1  |
> +-------+---------+----------+------------------+--------------------+
>
